    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d108-a4">

                <pb facs="0221" n="141" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg141"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr. Rönnow.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States,<lb/>Copenhagen</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1901-05-09"><hi rendition="#italic">May
                                9, 1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your letter of March 13 last,
                    and to mine of March 16, in reply thereto, I now beg to inform you that the
                    Danish ministry of justice has granted your request for permission to visit
                    Denmark before returning to the United States.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S.
                    Swenson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
